  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot gelecek sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Gelecek i\xE7in \"Kupa \xDC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nSevdi\u011Fin
    ve g\xFCvendi\u011Fin insanlar ya da baz\u0131 konularda bel ba\u011Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    bir arkada\u015F grubun var m\u0131 {{isim}}? Kart\u0131n, birilerinin seni hayal
    k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131na u\u011Fratabilecek davran\u0131\u015Flarda
    bulunaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret ediyor. Baz\u0131 planlar\u0131n, arana
    mesafe koyaca\u011F\u0131n insanlardan dolay\u0131 aksayabilir. En b\xFCy\xFCk
    zarar\u0131 ise \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC \u015Fah\u0131slardan g\xF6rme ihtimalin var.
    \u0130ki ki\u015Finin aras\u0131nda kalmas\u0131 gereken hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi
    \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC \u015Fah\u0131slara aktarmamal\u0131s\u0131n. Ne sevincini
    ne de h\xFCzn\xFCn\xFC birden fazla ki\u015Fiyle payla\u015Fmaman gerekti\u011Fini
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorum. Baz\u0131lar\u0131 laf ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131,
    ispiyoncu ya da kuyu kaz\u0131c\u0131 \xE7\u0131kabilir. Sana tak\u0131lmak istenen
    bu \xE7elmeleri \xF6nceden g\xF6rmeli, ona g\xF6re hareket etmelisin."
